'''Tentacruel''' (Japanese: '''ドククラゲ''' ''Dokukurage'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

