==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Tentacruel|61}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Poison Tentacles''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Brock's Omastar|68}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

